  "method": "Medians of within-query differences. Resample whole families with replacement, then take the median across all sampled queries. Wilcoxon exact two-sided conditional on the nonzero absolute differences, using average ranks for ties. The query test assumes independent symmetric signs; the family sensitivity uses one median difference per family. P values are descriptive and unadjusted for multiple comparisons. Intervals apply to measurable pairs.",
  "scope": "Original whole-request arms, including failures and early stops. Wall time ends at the executor and excludes rendering. B3 requires a complete meter for both seats. A negative paired difference favors the first arm on resource use only.",
